  "id": "deliskaplan-executive-function-system",
  "term": "Delis–Kaplan Executive Function System",
  "definition": "The Delis–Kaplan Executive Function System is a neuropsychological assessment used to examine executive functions, such as higher-level thinking skills involved in problem solving and decision making. In the supplied source, its Sorting Test is used to add assessment of executive functioning to broader cognitive testing for a more complete picture of cognitive difficulties.",
